{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，美國核聚變初創企業Marathon Fusion對外公佈重磅實驗成果。<strong>他們宣稱藉助核聚變產生的高能中子轟擊汞，通過核嬗變技術，把水銀（汞）轉化為穩定的黃金，轉化速率達到歐洲核子研究中心CERN此前紀錄的10倍，讓流傳千年的「鍊金術」從傳説走進實驗室。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583666.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:38.817774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_hash":"d639e3e786210d57d132f2a5ca9e58452ddc00eaea4439b7a5376eaccb5b257f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}